        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 480,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "10483fb8a883d547",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Chapter 4. Data Structures\nPengenalan terhadap struktur data awal seperti vector, stack, queue, dan lain lain.\n",
